        },
        {
          "text": "Sibhoono abhantö bha Yuta bhagaita bhonsui bhano bhaitërë Ömögambi Amoni. Hakurua abhantö bhayö bha Yuta bhagatööra Yosia ömoona waae köbha ömögambi kuibhaga reee.",
          "type": "text",
